flowchart TD
    A([Power on ESP32]) --> B[Init I2C bus SDA=21 SCL=22<br/>ADC GPIO33, 11 dB, 12-bit]
    B --> C[Init MLX90614, BMP280, DS3231<br/>missing sensor -> marked FAIL, keep running]
    C --> D[Connect WiFi]
    D --> E{WiFi up and<br/>NTP sync enabled?}
    E -- yes --> F[Set DS3231 from NTP<br/>UTC + 7 h]
    E -- no --> G
    F --> G[Read MQ-5 raw ADC 0-4095]
    G --> H[Append to buffer, keep last 5<br/>gas_avg = mean of buffer]
    H --> I{gas_avg}
    I -- "< 2100" --> I1[risk = SAFE, code 0]
    I -- "2100 - 2599" --> I2[risk = WARNING, code 1]
    I -- ">= 2600" --> I3[risk = DANGER, code 2]
    I1 --> J
    I2 --> J
    I3 --> J[Read MLX90614 body_temp]
    J --> K{body_temp >= 32.5 C?}
    K -- yes --> K1[fever_flag = 1]
    K -- no --> K0[fever_flag = 0]
    K1 --> L
    K0 --> L[Read BMP280 pressure hPa<br/>altitude = 44330 x 1 - P/1013.25 ^ 1/5.255]
    L --> M[Read DS3231 -> ISO timestamp]
    M --> N[Build JSON packet<br/>print raw vs avg to serial]
    N --> O{WiFi connected?}
    O -- no --> O1[Try reconnect,<br/>skip this send] --> T
    O -- yes --> P[HTTP POST to Node-RED /lab4/data]
    P --> Q[Node-RED: validate fields,<br/>DS3231 time as point time]
    Q --> R[(InfluxDB 2<br/>bucket iot, measurement lab4)]
    R --> S[Grafana dashboard<br/>refresh every 5 s]
    P --> T[Wait 2 s]
    T --> G
